---
description: Visually identify every selected image before proposing file organization
alwaysApply: true
---

For images in the active organization batch, use
`.agents/skills/review-images/SKILL.md`, `docs/IMAGE_REVIEW.md` and
`tools/image_review.py`. Inspect each image, even when its filename sounds clear.
Record its plain-language description, category, confidence, uncertainty and
visual evidence against the exact source SHA-256 in ignored `.local/`.
Show descriptions alongside filenames before asking for filing approval.
Unreviewed or ambiguous images remain holds; labels alone are insufficient.
Selected retrieval/private previews need no extra inspection prompt; bulk
hydration, external classifier uploads and automatic moves remain unauthorized.
`AGENTS.md` remains canonical. Classification does not prove inactivity,
dependency freedom, duplicates or Google Photos backup coverage.
